{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6959aa9dc5a833d992b","chatId":"c59c7db35cc146f4a7048ec1a533a35f","sessionId":null,"userId":99249,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"E\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"E\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":13672,"promptTokens":548,"completionTokens":440,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:44:21"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0059090984460746605,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6959aa9dc5a833d992a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483861041,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:44:21","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6959aa9dc5a833d992a","chatId":"c59c7db35cc146f4a7048ec1a533a35f","sessionId":null,"userId":99249,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小詹和我是同事。我们十多年来一直是最好的朋友。我们的老板每年会颁发员工奖。今年，我们都申请了这个奖项，并且都很努力想拿奖。昨天结果出来了。我朋友得奖了。当我们得知这个消息时，他笑了但是没有庆祝。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，我最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 失望 & 钦佩\nB) 自豪 & 不关心\nC) 钦佩 & 娱乐\nD) 失望 & 娱乐\nE) 钦佩 & 不关心\nF) 自豪 & 悔恨\n\n## 问题 2\n我为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 我曾经期待詹姆斯庆祝他的胜利，但他的反应让我失望 & 我坚信我们的老板在他的决定中存在偏见\nB) 我对朋友赢得奖项而不是我感到不安 & 我欣赏我们的老板能做出公正的决定\nC) 我觉得不够优秀，不配得奖 & 我曾经期待詹姆斯庆祝他的胜利，但他的反应让我失望\nD) 我把小詹当做我最好的朋友，相信他很努力才赢得了这个奖 & 我坚信我们的老板在他的决定中存在偏见\nE) 我觉得不够优秀，不配得奖 & 我把小詹当做我最好的朋友，相信他很努力才赢得了这个奖\nF) 我曾经期待詹姆斯庆祝他的胜利，但他的反应让我失望 & 我欣赏我们的老板能做出公正的决定","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0059090984460746605,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6959aa9dc5a833d992b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483861038,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:44:21","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f36628e5f3ba4302867e431d11ab6e21"}